ce data, not official FEC totals.","profile_src":["https://www.trackaipac.com/2028","https://www.trackaipac.com/congress","https://www.ohchr.org/en/press-releases/2025/09/israel-has-committed-genocide-gaza-strip-un-commission-finds"],"profile_status":"reported"},{"id":"PER-NEW-DESANTIS","name":"Ron DeSantis","type":"Person","role":"Governor of Florida (2028 presidential contender)","country":"USA","slug":"ron-desantis","profile":"Ron DeSantis (Governor of Florida) appears on Track AIPAC's list of likely 2028 presidential contenders; Track AIPAC is an advocacy project that follows pro-Israel lobby money in U.S. politics. Track AIPAC's 2028 tracker credits DeSantis with $56,373 in Israel-lobby money, all of it from PACs and donors. AIPAC, its super PAC United Democracy Project and allied PACs use this money to reward politicians who keep U.S. weapons flowing to Israel; the UN Commission of Inquiry concluded in September 2025 that Israel committed genocide in Gaza. The tracker's numbers are an advocacy tally built from campaign-finance data, not official FEC totals.","profile_src":["https://www.trackaipac.com/2028","https://www.ohchr.org/en/press-releases/2025/09/israel-has-committed-genocide-gaza-strip-un-commission-finds"],"profile_status":"reported"},{"id":"PER-NEW-RFKJR","name":"Robert F. Kennedy Jr.","type":"Person","role":"U.S. Secretary of Health and Human Services (2028 presidential contender)","country":"USA","slug":"robert-f-kennedy-jr","profile":"Robert F. Kennedy Jr. (U.S. Secretary of Health and Human Services) appears on Track AIPAC's list of likely 2028 presidential contenders; Track AIPAC is an advocacy project that follows pro-Israel lobby money in U.S. politics. The tracker shows no Israel-lobby money data for Kennedy but rates his record as pro-Israel. AIPAC, its super PAC United Democracy Project and allied PACs use this money to reward politicians who keep U.S. weapons flowing to Israel; the UN Commission of Inquiry concluded in September 2025 that