granted €169m ... Greece €114m ... Romania €103m ... the Czechs €35m ... Finland €17m ... Hungary (€6m), Latvia (€4m), and Croatia (€2m) ... Austria, Bulgaria, Cyprus, Estonia, Lithuania, Luxembourg, the Netherlands, and Poland each also issued €1m or fewer","pg":null}]},{"id":"REL-V0130","t":"money","a":"CTY-00010","b":"CTY-00001","rel":"licensed_arms_exports_to","amt":103000000,"cur":"EUR","pct":null,"date":"2024","st":"documented","ctx":"Romania granted about €103M of arms export licences to Israel in 2024, per EU data reported by EUobserver (licences, not deliveries).","ev":[{"s":"SRC-V0049","ex":"France granted some €362m of arms-export licences to Israel in 2024 ... Germany granted €169m ... Greece €114m ... Romania €103m ... the Czechs €35m ... Finland €17m ... Hungary (€6m), Latvia (€4m), and Croatia (€2m) ... Austria, Bulgaria, Cyprus, Estonia, Lithuania, Luxembourg, the Netherlands, and Poland each also issued €1m or fewer","pg":null}]},{"id":"REL-V0131","t":"money","a":"CTY-00009","b":"CTY-00001","rel":"licensed_arms_exports_to","amt":35000000,"cur":"EUR","pct":null,"date":"2024","st":"documented","ctx":"Czechia granted about €35M of arms export licences to Israel in 2024, per EU data reported by EUobserver (licences, not deliveries).","ev":[{"s":"SRC-V0049","ex":"France granted some €362m of arms-export licences to Israel in 2024 ... Germany granted €169m ... Greece €114m ... Romania €103m ... the Czechs €35m ... Finland €17m ... Hungary (€6m), Latvia (€4m), and Croatia (€2m) ... Austria, Bulgaria, Cyprus, Estonia, Lithuania, Luxembourg, the Netherlands, and Poland each also issued €1m or fewer","pg":null}]},{"id":"REL-V0132","t":"money","a":"CTY-00017","b":"CTY-00001","rel":"licensed_arms_exports_to","amt":17000000,"cur":"EUR","pct":null,"date":"2024","st":"documented","ctx":"Finland granted about €17M of arms export licences to Israel in 2024, per EU data reported by EUobserver (licences, not deliveries).","ev":[{"s":"SRC-V0049","ex":"France granted some €362m of arms-export licences to Israel in 2024 ... Germany granted €169m ... Greece €114m ... Romania €103m ... the Czechs €35m ... Finland €17m ... Hungary (€6m), Latvia (€4m), and Croatia (€2m) ... Austria, Bulgaria, Cyprus, Estonia, Lithuania, Luxembourg, the Netherlands, and Poland each also issued €1m or fewer","pg":null}]},{"id":"REL-V0133","t":"money","a":"CTY-00019","b":"CTY-00001","rel":"licensed_arms_exports_to","amt":6000000,"cur":"EUR","pct":null,"date":"2024","st":"documented","ctx":"Hungary granted about €6M of arms export licences to Israel in 2024, per EU data reported by EUobserver (licences, not deliveries).","ev":[{"s":"SRC-V0049","ex":"France granted some €362m of arms-export licences to Israel in 2024 ... Germany granted €169m ... Greece €114m ... Romania €103m ... the Czechs €35m ... Finland €17m ... Hungary (€6m), Latvia (€4m), and Croatia (€2m) ... Austria, Bulgaria, Cyprus, Estonia, Lithuania, Luxembourg, the Netherlands, and Poland each also issued €1m or fewer","pg":null}]},{"id":"REL-V0134","t":"money","a":"CTY-00003","b":"CTY-00001","rel":"licensed_arms_exports_to","amt":1410000000,"cur":"EUR","pct":null,"date":"2023-10 to 2026-06","st":"documented","ctx":"Forensis counts about €1.41B of German licences for military equipment and war weapons to Israel from October 2023 to June 2026, including €799.3M in H1 2026.","ev":[{"s":"SRC-V0039","ex":"Germany approved arms export licences worth approximately 326.5 million Euro in 2023, 163.8 million Euro in 2024, 201.6 million Euro in 2025 ... 799.3 million Euro in the first six months of 2026 ... between October 2023 and June 2026 amount to a total of approximately 1.41 billion Euro","pg":null}]},{"id":"REL-V0135","t":"ownership","a":"CTY-00003","b":"CTY-00001","rel":"arms_supplier_share","amt":null,"cur":null,"pct":31,"date":"2021–2025","st":"documented","ctx":"SIPRI: Germany supplied 31% of Israel's major arms imports in 2021–25.","ev":[{"s":"SRC-V0034","ex":"The USA was the largest supplier to Israel in 2021–25 (accounting for 68 per cent of Israeli arms imports), followed by Germany (31 per cent).","pg":null}]},{"id":"REL-V0136","t":"money","a":"CTY-00005","b":"CTY-00001","rel":"licensed_arms_exports_to","amt":127600000,"cur":"GBP","pct":null,"date":"2024-10 to 2024-12","st":"documented","ctx":"CAAT: the UK approved £127.6M of single-issue licences for military equipment to Israel in Q4 2024, more than 2020–2023 combined; F-35 components exempted from the Sept 2024 partial suspension.","ev":[{"s":"SRC-V0047","ex":"the UK approved licenses for £127.6 million worth of military equipment to Israel in single issue licenses between October to December 2024. ... UK industry makes 15% of every F-35","pg":null},{"s":"SRC-V0048","ex":"licences for the export of components for F-35 combat aircraft which could not be identified as destined for Israel","pg":null}]},{"id":"REL-V0137","t":"money","a":"CTY-00004","b":"CTY-00001","rel":"arms_exports_to","amt":5800000,"cur":"EUR","pct":null,"date":"2024","st":"documented","ctx":"ISTAT Coeweb data cited by Il Fatto Quotidiano show about €5.8M of arms, ammunition and parts exported to Israel in 2024 despite government claims of a halt.","ev":[{"s":"SRC-V0044","ex":"Nel 2024 ... l'Italia autorizzava, testimoniano i dati Coeweb ... esportazioni di 'armi, munizioni e loro parti ed accessori per circa 5,8 milioni di euro ... una cooperazione stabile nel programma degli aerei F-35, con componentistica prodotta in Italia e destinata ai velivoli israeliani","pg":null}]},{"id":"REL-V0138","t":"money","a":"CTY-00021","b":"CTY-00001","rel":"ammunition_exports_to","amt":55500000,"cur":"EUR","pct":null,"date":"2025-01 to 2025-06","st":"reported","ctx":"BIRN/Haaretz: Serbian ammunition exports to Israel were €55.5M in H1 2025, after €47.9M in 2024.","ev":[{"s":"SRC-V0075","ex":"€47.9 million (2024) ... €55.5 million (first half of 2025)","pg":null}]},{"id":"REL-V0139","t":"edge","a":"CTY-00003","b":"CTR-00006","rel":"procures_via","amt":null,"cur":null,"pct":null,"date":"2023-09-28 onward","st":"documented","ctx":"Germany's Arrow 3 purchase from IAI, now above $6.5B.","ev":[{"s":"SRC-V0034","ex":"The USA was the largest supplier to Israel in 2021–25 (accounting for 68 per cent of Israeli arms imports), followed by Germany (31 per cent).","pg":null}]},{"id":"REL-V0140","t":"edge","a":"CTY-00003","b":"COM-00009","rel":"procures_from","amt":2000000000,"cur":"EUR","pct":null,"date":"2025-10-24","st":"documented","ctx":"€2B Spike missile contract signed via NSPA with EuroSpike, led by Rafael with Rheinmetall and Diehl.","ev":[{"s":"SRC-V0042","ex":"The contract was signed with EuroSpike, a European joint venture based in Bavaria and led by Tel Aviv's Rafael, with German companies Rheinmetall Electronics and Diehl Defence holding an 80 percent stake. (2 billion euros ($2.3 billion))","pg":null}]},{"id":"REL-V0141","t":"edge","a":"CTY-00017","b":"CTR-00007","rel":"procures_via","amt":316000000,"cur":"EUR","pct":null,"date":"2023-11","st":"documented","ctx":"Finland's David's Sling procurement; minister refused to cancel in Aug 2025.","ev":[{"s":"SRC-V0072","ex":"There are no talks about cancelling the deal, it is proceeding as planned","pg":null}]},{"id":"REL-V0142","t":"edge","a":"CTY-00014","b":"CTR-00008","rel":"procures_via","amt":null,"cur":null,"pct":null,"date":"2023","st":"documented","ctx":"Denmark's ATMOS/PULS purchase from Elbit.","ev":[{"s":"SRC-V0069","ex":"Danish media Danwatch and Information revealed in 2023 that Israel's F-35s were equipped with parts made by Danish company Terma.","pg":null}]},{"id":"REL-V0143","t":"edge","a":"CTY-00018","b":"CTR-00009","rel":"procures_via","amt":560000000,"cur":"EUR","pct":null,"date":"2024-12-23","st":"documented","ctx":"Slovakia's Barak MX purchase from IAI.","ev":[{"s":"SRC-V0058","ex":"Between 2014-2022 the total value of export licences between Bulgaria and Israel total €49 million ... from Slovakia to Israel totalled €117 million ... Hungary ... over €15 million ... the Czech Republic has transferred over €127 million ... Austria ... €33 million ... Poland ... just shy of €4.9 million ... Spain ... €99 million ... Belgium has transferred €46 million ... Romania ... €427 million","pg":null}]},{"id":"REL-V0144","t":"edge","a":"CTY-00015","b":"CTR-00010","rel":"procures_via","amt":3000000000,"cur":"EUR","pct":null,"date":"2026-08-31","st":"documented","ctx":"Greece's Achilles Shield package (David's Sling, SPYDER, Barak MX).","ev":[{"s":"SRC-V0070","ex":"Greece is formally acquiring the Precise and Universal Launching System (PULS) rocket artillery system in a $750 million agreement ... The deal includes the launchers as well as training rockets, precision-guided rockets and loitering munitions.","pg":null}]},{"id":"REL-V0145","t":"edge","a":"CTY-00015","b":"COM-00007","rel":"procures_from","amt":750000000,"cur":"USD","pct":null,"date":"2026-04","st":"documented","ctx":"Greece's $750M PULS rocket artillery deal with Elbit.","ev":[{"s":"SRC-V0070","ex":"Greece is formally acquiring the Precise and Universal Launching System (PULS) rocket artillery system in a $750 million agreement ... The deal includes the launchers as well as training rockets, precision-guided rockets and loitering munitions.","pg":null}]},{"id":"REL-V0146","t":"edge","a":"CTY-00007","b":"COM-00007","rel":"procures_from","amt":305000000,"cur":"USD","pct":null,"date":"2023-05-18","st":"documented","ctx":"Dutch G2G deal for 20 Elbit PULS systems.","ev":[{"s":"SRC-V0054","ex":"it was awarded a contract worth $305 million to supply Precise & Universal Launching System (PULS) artillery rocket systems to the Royal Netherlands Army","pg":null}]},{"id":"REL-V0147","t":"edge","a":"CTY-00010","b":"COM-00009","rel":"procures_from","amt":2000000000,"cur":"EUR","pct":null,"date":"2025-07-21","st":"documented","ctx":"Romanian SPYDER framework agreement with Rafael, more than €2B ($2.3B).","ev":[{"s":"SRC-V0062","ex":"more than 2 billion euros ($2.3 billion) (SPYDER framework agreement with Rafael Advanced Defense Systems)","pg":null}]},{"id":"REL-V0148","t":"edge","a":"CTY-00010","b":"COM-00007","rel":"procures_from","amt":400000000,"cur":"USD","pct":null,"date":"reported 2025-11","st":"reported","ctx":"Romania's $400M deal with Elbit for seven Watchkeeper X systems.","ev":[{"s":"SRC-V0063","ex":"Romania's Defense Ministry concluded a USD 400 million deal with Israeli company Elbit for the development of seven Watchkeeper X systems","pg":null}]},{"id":"REL-V0149","t":"edge","a":"CTY-00009","b":"COM-00009","rel":"procures_from","amt":627000000,"cur":"USD","pct":null,"date":"2021-09-28","st":"documented","ctx":"Czech SPYDER purchase, four launchers due by 2026.","ev":[{"s":"SRC-V0060","ex":"13.69 billion koruna (US$627 million) ... Deliveries of the four launchers are scheduled to be completed by 2026","pg":null}]},{"id":"REL-V0150","t":"money","a":"CTY-00012","b":"COM-00009","rel":"licensed_production_of","amt":100000000,"cur":"USD","pct":null,"date":"2023-08-07","st":"documented","ctx":"Mesko to produce hundreds of Rafael Spike missiles, contract near $100M.","ev":[{"s":"SRC-V0067","ex":"near $100 million, according to a statement released by the Israeli vendor (Spike missiles to be made by Mesko under Rafael licence)","pg":null}]},{"id":"REL-V0151","t":"edge","a":"CTY-00013","b":"COM-00007","rel":"procures_from","amt":null,"cur":null,"pct":null,"date":"2025-08","st":"documented","ctx":"Austrian army buys 315 Magni-X drones from Elbit Systems Deutschland.","ev":[{"s":"SRC-V0068","ex":"315 Magni-X tactical reconnaissance drones ... an option to acquire an additional 300 drones (Elbit Systems Deutschland)","pg":null}]},{"id":"REL-V0152","t":"edge","a":"CTY-00016","b":"COM-00008","rel":"procures_from","amt":null,"cur":null,"pct":null,"date":"2024-12","st":"documented","ctx":"Cyprus receives IAI Barak MX; value undisclosed.","ev":[{"s":"SRC-V0071","ex":"Initial deliveries of the system have reportedly arrived in recent days (Barak MX, Israel Aerospace Industries)","pg":null}]},{"id":"REL-V0153","t":"edge","a":"CTY-00021","b":"COM-00007","rel":"procures_from","amt":1630000000,"cur":"USD","pct":null,"date":"2025-08","st":"reported","ctx":"Serbia identified as buyer of $1.63B Elbit package incl. Hermes 900 drones.","ev":[{"s":"SRC-V0076","ex":"Serbia revealed as buyer in Elbit's $1.63 billion arms deal ... Hermes 900 drones, long-range precision missiles, electronic warfare systems, and command-and-control platforms","pg":null}]},{"id":"REL-V0154","t":"edge","a":"CTY-00008","b":"COM-00007","rel":"contract_cancelled_with","amt":700000000,"cur":"EUR","pct":null,"date":"2025-09-09","st":"documented","ctx":"Spain cancelled the ~€700M SILAM (PULS-derived) contract; Elbit's share would have been €150M.","ev":[{"s":"SRC-V0056","ex":"The Spanish government has canceled a contract worth nearly 700 million euros ($825 million) for Israeli-designed rocket launchers ... 12 SILAM rocket launcher systems, derived from the PULS platform made by Israeli firm Elbit Systems","pg":null}]},{"id":"REL-V0155","t":"edge","a":"CTY-00008","b":"COM-00009","rel":"procures_from","amt":285000000,"cur":"EUR","pct":null,"date":"2026","st":"reported","ctx":"Spain's €285M Spike deal moved to EuroSpike, 20% owned by Rafael.","ev":[{"s":"SRC-V0057","ex":"168 launchers, 1,680 missiles and full logistical support ... EuroSpike ... euro285 million deal","pg":null}]},{"id":"REL-V0156","t":"edge","a":"CTY-00005","b":"COM-00006","rel":"home_country_of","amt":null,"cur":null,"pct":null,"date":null,"st":"documented","ctx":"BAE Systems is a principal UK F-35 partner; UK industry makes 15% of every F-35.","ev":[{"s":"SRC-V0047","ex":"the UK approved licenses for £127.6 million worth of military equipment to Israel in single issue licenses between October to December 2024. ... UK industry makes 15% of every F-35","pg":null}]},{"id":"REL-V0157","t":"edge","a":"CTY-00004","b":"COM-00025","rel":"home_country_of","amt":null,"cur":null,"pct":null,"date":null,"st":"reported","ctx":"Leonardo is Italy's state-controlled weapons manufacturer; the Italian Treasury holds 30.2%. Leonardo says its F-35 wing and maintenance work at Cameri is not destined for Israel.","ev":[{"s":"SRC-V0044","ex":"Nel 2024 ... l'Italia autorizzava, testimoniano i dati Coeweb ... esportazioni di 'armi, munizioni e loro parti ed accessori per circa 5,8 milioni di euro ... una cooperazione stabile nel programma degli aerei F-35, con componentistica prodotta in Italia e destinata ai velivoli israeliani","pg":null},{"s":"SRC-V0320","ex":"Le produzioni di assiemi alari (Wing) e i servizi di supporto (MRO&U) effettuati presso lo stabilimento di Cameri a fronte dei contratti con Lockheed Martin (LM) sono destinati da LM stessa anche a Paesi terzi, ma NON allo Stato di Israele.","pg":null}]},{"id":"REL-V0158","t":"edge","a":"CTY-00001","b":"GOV-00005","rel":"country_governed_by","amt":null,"cur":null,"pct":null,"date":null,"st":"documented","ctx":"The Government of Israel governs the Israel country node.","ev":[{"s":"SRC-V0025","ex":"Israeli authorities and Israeli security forces committed four of the five genocidal acts defined by the 1948 Convention on the Prevention and Punishment of the Crime of Genocide","pg":null}]},{"id":"REL-V0159","t":"election","a":"ORG-00003","b":"PER-V001","rel":"spent_supporting","amt":2000000,"cur":"USD","pct":null,"date":"NC-04 Dem primary · 2022 · won","st":"reported","ctx":"United Democracy Project, AIPAC's super PAC, spent about $2.0M backing Valerie Foushee in the 2022 NC-04 Dem primary. Result: won.","ev":[{"s":"SRC-V0287","ex":null,"pg":null}]},{"id":"REL-V0160","t":"election","a":"ORG-00003","b":"PER-V002","rel":"spent_supporting","amt":280000,"cur":"USD","pct":null,"date":"OH-11 Dem primary · 2022 · won","st":"reported","ctx":"United Democracy Project, AIPAC's super PAC, spent about $0.3M backing Shontel Brown in the 2022 OH-11 Dem primary. Result: won.","ev":[{"s":"SRC-V0287","ex":nul