,"cur":null,"pct":null,"date":"2026","ctx":"Claude was embedded in Maven during the 2026 Iran campaign and reported by the Washington Post to support target generation and prioritization. No public evidence establishes that Claude selected, recommended or processed the Minab school target.","id":"REL-W0003","st":"reported","ev":[{"s":"SRC-W0006","ex":"Maven, powered by Claude, suggested hundreds of targets, issued precise location coordinates, and prioritized those targets according to importance","pg":null},{"s":"SRC-W0007","ex":"uses multiple prompts and workflows that were built using Anthropic's Claude code","pg":null}],"t":"edge"},{"a":"GOV-00007","b":"WPN-NEW-LAVENDER","rel":"uses","amt":null,"cur":null,"pct":null,"date":"2023-2024","ctx":"Lavender marked some 37,000 Palestinians as suspected militants for assassination, +972 and Local Call reported.","id":"REL-W0004","st":"reported","ev":[{"s":"SRC-W0004","ex":"Lavender has marked some 37,000 Palestinians as suspected 'Hamas militants,'","pg":null}],"t":"edge"},{"a":"GOV-00007","b":"WPN-NEW-GOSPEL","rel":"uses","amt":null,"cur":null,"pct":null,"date":"2023","ctx":"The Gospel generates building targets almost automatically; a former officer called it a 'mass assassination factory'.","id":"REL-W0005","st":"reported","ev":[{"s":"SRC-W0005","ex":"essentially facilitates a 'mass assassination factory.'","pg":null}],"t":"edge"},{"a":"GOV-00007","b":"WPN-NEW-WHERESDADDY","rel":"uses","amt":null,"cur":null,"pct":null,"date":"2023-2024","ctx":"'Where's Daddy?' tracked marked people so they could be bombed at home with their families.","id":"REL-W0006","st":"reported","ev":[{"s":"SRC-W0004","ex":"were used specifically to track the targeted individuals and carry out bombings when they had entered their family's residences","pg":null}],"t":"edge"},{"a":"COM-00016","b":"GOV-00006","rel":"sold_engineering_support_to","amt":10000000,"cur":"USD","pct":null,"date":"2023-10 to 2024-06","ctx":"The Israel Ministry of Defense sp