C-W0101","ex":"A new port at Haifa, Israel, developed and operated by Shanghai International Port (SIPG), has officially commenced operation.","pg":null},{"s":"SRC-W0101","ex":"In 2015, Israel Port authority granted SIPG a 25-year concession to run the port.","pg":null}],"t":"edge"},{"a":"CTY-G-RW","b":"CTY-00001","rel":"spyware_client_of_israeli_firm","amt":3500,"cur":"units","pct":null,"date":"2016-2021","ctx":"Rwanda selected more than 3,500 numbers for Pegasus targeting (NSO Group, Israel).","id":"REL-G0054","st":"documented","ev":[{"s":"SRC-W0104","ex":"The Rwandan authorities have selected more than 3,500 phone numbers of activists, journalists, political opponents, foreign politicians, and diplomats to target with NSO Pegasus spyware since 2016.","pg":null}],"t":"money"},{"a":"CTY-G-CM","b":"CTY-00001","rel":"arms_client_of","amt":null,"cur":null,"pct":null,"date":"2009-2022","ctx":"BIR armed with IWI rifles and overseen by ex-IDF officers (DIMSE).","id":"REL-G0055","st":"reported","ev":[{"s":"SRC-W0105","ex":"Each new recruit since 2009 has received a brand-new firearm produced by Israel Weapon Industries (IWI)","pg":null},{"s":"SRC-W0105","ex":"continuously overseen by former IDF officers","pg":null}],"t":"edge"},{"a":"CTY-G-KE","b":"CTY-00001","rel":"surveillance_client_of","amt":null,"cur":null,"pct":null,"date":"2024/2026","ctx":"Kenyan police used Ispra riot gear in 2024, and Cellebrite tools were used on an activist's phone (DIMSE, Citizen Lab).","id":"REL-G0056","st":"reported","ev":[{"s":"SRC-W0102","ex":"In 2024, over 60 people died during civil protests against the government's fiscal policies and handling of the economic crisis. Footage from these demonstrations show the police used \"less lethal\" riot gear produced by the Israeli company Ispra","pg":null},{"s":"SRC-W0102","ex":"In 2026 an investigation by CitizenLab found that Cellebrite's forensic extraction tools were used on the phone of Boniface Mwangi","pg":null}],"t":"edge"},{"a":"CTY-G-NG","b":"CTY-00001","rel":"surveillance_client_of","amt":null,"cur":null,"pct":null,"date":"2020","ctx":"Nigeria's Defence Intelligence Agency was identified as a likely client of Circles, an NSO affiliate.","id":"REL-G0057","st":"reported","ev":[{"s":"SRC-W0103","ex":"The other client appears to be the Nigerian Defence Intelligence Agency (DIA), as its firewall IPs are in AS37258, a block of IP addresses registered to \"HQ Defence Intelligence Agency Asokoro, Nigeria, Abuja,\" it added.","pg":null}],"t":"edge"},{"a":"CTY-G-TD","b":"CTY-00001","rel":"recalled_ambassador","amt":null,"cur":null,"pct":null,"date":"2023-11-05","ctx":"Chad recalled its ambassador over Gaza.","id":"REL-G0058","st":"reported","ev":[{"s":"SRC-W0106","ex":"On 5 November 2023, Chad recalled its ambassador to Israel, accusing the country of creating an unprecedented humanitarian catastrophe and killing innocent people in Gaza.","pg":null}],"t":"edge"},{"a":"CTY-G-CO","b":"CTY-00001","rel":"cut_diplomatic_ties","amt":null,"cur":null,"pct":null,"date":"2024-05-01","ctx":"Petro announced the break, calling Israel's leader 'genocidal'.","id":"REL-G0059","st":"documented","ev":[{"s":"SRC-W0085","ex":"announces that tomorrow we will break diplomatic relations with the state of Israel … for having a government, for having a president who is genocidal.","pg":null}],"t":"edge"},{"a":"COM-G-ADANIELBIT","b":"CTY-G-IN","rel":"based_in","ctx":"Adani-Elbit Advanced Systems India builds Hermes drones at its plant in Hyderabad, India.","id":"REL-G0060","st":"documented","ev":[{"s":"SRC-W0059","ex":null,"pg":null}],"amt":null,"cur":null,"pct":null,"date":null,"t":"edge"},{"a":"COM-G-MUNITIONSINDIA","b":"CTY-G-IN","rel":"state_owned_by","ctx":"Munitions India Limited is owned by the Government of India.","id":"REL-G0061","st":"documented","ev":[{"s":"SRC-W0060","ex":null,"pg":null}],"amt":null,"cur":null,"pct":null,"date":null,"t":"edge"},{"a":"COM-G-PREMIER","b":"CTY-G-IN","rel":"based_in","ctx":"Premier Explosi