":"Hotel Workers for Stronger Communities $810,322","pg":null}],"t":"election"},{"a":"PER-NEW-BIDEN","b":"CTY-00001","rel":"approved_arms_for","amt":null,"cur":null,"t":"edge","ctx":"Emergency sales bypassing Congress (Dec 2023), at least 14,000 MK-84 2,000-lb bombs, ~$17B April 2024 package; Costs of War: $17.9B military aid in year one.","id":"REL-U0077","st":"reported","ev":[{"s":"SRC-W0273","ex":"The United States has provided at least $17.9 billion in military aid to Israel since October 7, 2023 ... \"artillery shells to 2,000-pound bunker-busters and precision-guided bombs\"","pg":null},{"s":"SRC-W0253","ex":"\"at least 14,000 of the MK-84 2,000-pound bombs, 6,500 500-pound bombs\"","pg":null}],"pct":null,"date":null},{"a":"PER-NEW-HARRIS","b":"CTY-00001","rel":"pledged_arms_for","amt":null,"cur":null,"t":"edge","ctx":"'I will always ensure Israel has the ability to defend itself' (DNC, Aug 2024); said 'No' to changing arms policy; adviser: she 'has not supported an arms embargo'.","id":"REL-U0078","st":"reported","ev":[{"s":"SRC-W0280","ex":"\"Let me be clear, I will always stand up for Israel's right to defend itself and I will always ensure Israel has the ability to defend itself.\"","pg":null},{"s":"SRC-W0281","ex":"\"I'm unequivocal and unwavering in my commitment to Israel's defense and its ability to defend itself, and that's not going to change.\"","pg":null}],"pct":null,"date":null},{"a":"PER-NEW-HARRIS","b":"PER-NEW-BIDEN","rel":"vice_president_to","amt":null,"cur":null,"t":"edge","ctx":"Vice president in the administration that armed Israel and vetoed four UNSC ceasefire resolutions.","id":"REL-U0079","st":"reported","ev":[{"s":"SRC-W0272","ex":"the fourth veto of a UNSC Gaza ceasefire resolution under President Joe Biden's administration","pg":null},{"s":"SRC-W0278","ex":"\"@VP has not supported an arms embargo on Israel. She will continue to work to protect civilians in Gaza.\" ... \"People we love are being killed with American bombs\"","pg":null}],"pct":null,"date":null},{"a":"ORG-00008","b":"PER-NEW-HARRIS","rel":"donated_to_campaign_of","amt":6000000,"cur":"USD","t":"money","ctx":"More than $6 million raised for her 2024 campaign through J Street (Sludge, Oct 2024).","id":"REL-U0080","st":"reported","ev":[{"s":"SRC-W0282","ex":"\"The Kamala Harris campaign has received more than $6 million from the pro-Israel lobbying group J Street\"","pg":null},{"s":"SRC-W0265","ex":"\"We are here to denounce the hypocrisy of our elected officials, Killer Kamala and Genocide Joe!\"","pg":null}],"pct":null,"date":null},{"a":"PER-00023","b":"PER-NEW-VANCE","rel":"funded_super_pac_for","amt":15000000,"cur":"USD","t":"money","ctx":"Thiel gave $15M to Protect Ohio Values super PAC for Vance's 2022 Senate run and employed him at Mithril Capital (CBS News).","id":"REL-U0081","st":"reported","ev":[{"s":"SRC-W0284","ex":"\"Thiel made $15 million in donations to Vance's SuperPAC, Protect Ohio Values, a staggering amount from a single individual for a Senate race\" ... Thiel hired Vance at Mithril Capital","pg":null},{"s":"SRC-W0283","ex":"JD Vance ... $53,985 in pro-Israel PAC support in past federal races (2022)","pg":null}],"pct":null,"date":null},{"a":"PER-NEW-VANCE","b":"COM-00010","rel":"linked_via_patron","amt":null,"cur":null,"t":"edge","ctx":"Palantir, co-founded by his patron Thiel, partnered with Israel's military for 'war-related missions' (Jan 2024); UN rapporteur cites AI targeting.","id":"REL-U0082","st":"reported","ev":[{"s":"SRC-W0285","ex":"\"Both parties have mutually agreed to harness Palantir's advanced technology in support of war-related missions.\"","pg":null},{"s":"SRC-W0288","ex":"\"signed a declaration to use emergency authorities to expedite the delivery of approximately $4 billion in military assistance to Israel\" ... over 35,500 MK 84 and BLU-117 bombs","pg":null}],"pct":null,"date":null},{"a":"PER-NEW-VANCE","b":"PER-N-TRUMP","rel":"vice_president_to","amt":null,"cur":null,"t":"edge","ctx":"Vice pr