raeli municipalities, 2024","y":27800000},{"x":"Bernie Marcus (with Billi Marcus) – MDA blood centre, 2016","y":25000000},{"x":"Larry Ellison – Friends of the IDF, 2017","y":16600000},{"x":"Bernie Marcus – Friends of the IDF, 2009–2022","y":13000000},{"x":"Stephen Schwarzman – National Library of Israel, 2018","y":10000000},{"x":"Bernie Marcus – AIPAC, 2023 (reported)","y":2000000}],"src":"CTech (Calcalist), Tel Aviv University, American Friends of Magen David Adom, Fox Business, eJewishPhilanthropy, Wikipedia, Jewish Telegraphic Agency, Times of Israel"},{"id":"SER-W014","case":"11","label":"Net worth of the people named in this file (Forbes real-time, Sept–Oct 2026)","unit":"USD","kind":"bar","points":[{"x":"Jeff Bezos","y":371200000000},{"x":"Larry Ellison","y":184200000000},{"x":"Michael Bloomberg","y":94900000000},{"x":"Abigail Johnson","y":41600000000},{"x":"Stephen Schwarzman","y":40500000000},{"x":"Miriam Adelson & family","y":31400000000},{"x":"Jonathan Gray","y":9200000000},{"x":"Paul Singer","y":7200000000},{"x":"Haim Saban","y":3300000000},{"x":"Larry Fink","y":1300000000}],"src":"Forbes"},{"id":"SER-W015","case":"11","label":"Friends of the IDF revenue by year","unit":"USD","kind":"col","points":[{"x":"2018","y":139300000},{"x":"2022","y":89340000},{"x":"2023","y":281960000}],"src":"Wikipedia"},{"id":"SER-W016","case":"11","label":"Assets under management of the big asset managers (latest reported)","unit":"USD","kind":"bar","points":[{"x":"BlackRock (Q2 2026)","y":15300000000000},{"x":"Vanguard (2025)","y":13300000000000},{"x":"Fidelity (Dec 2025)","y":7100000000000},{"x":"State Street (Dec 2025)","y":5700000000000},{"x":"Capital Group (June 2026)","y":3600000000000}],"src":"Private Banker International (via data.json), Vanguard, Fidelity Investments, State Street (via data.json), Capital Group (via data.json)"},{"id":"SER-W017","case":"FND-00001","label":"BlackRock stakes named in UN report A/HRC/59/23, %","unit":"%","kind":"bar","points":[{"x":"Palan