_Services_Committee_(2023)_02.png"},"PER-00015":{"data":"img/7182db4d37bd1be0.jpg","credit":"Photo: Senate Committee on Commerce, Science, and Transportation / Wikimedia Commons, Public domain","url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Ortberg-Senate_(cropped).png"},"PER-00022":{"data":"img/18f9596dff0c45f9.jpg","credit":"Photo: UK Government / Wikimedia Commons, CC BY 2.0","url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Alex_Karp_attends_AI_Summit_(53302457013)_(cropped).jpg"},"PER-00023":{"data":"img/73de1bdb684b9a8f.jpg","credit":"Photo: Dan Taylor / Wikimedia Commons, CC BY 2.0","url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Peter_Thiel_(2014).jpg"},"PER-00024":{"data":"img/5b1f6907869835f0.jpg","credit":"Photo: Daniel Oberhaus / Wikimedia Commons, CC BY 4.0","url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Jeff_Bezos_Unveils_Blue_Origin_Lunar_Lander_(cropped).jpg"},"PER-00025":{"data":"img/57d19b4ca1d76140.jpg","credit":"Photo: JD Lasica / Wikimedia Commons, CC BY 2.0","url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Andy_Jassy_in_2010_(cropped).jpg"},"PER-00026":{"data":"img/4181217857c6cbd2.jpg","credit":"Photo: Photographer: Lukasz Kobus (European Commission) / Wikimedia Commons, CC BY 4.0","url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Sundar_Pichai_-_2023_(cropped).jpg"},"PER-00027":{"data":"img/814bc4b24c56a4c3.jpg","credit":"Photo: Stansfield PL / Wikimedia Commons, CC BY-SA 3.0","url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Larry_Page_in_the_European_Parliament,_17.06.2009_(cropped).jpg"},"PER-00028":{"data":"img/0be8ff15b1519573.jpg","credit":"Photo: Jyri Engeström / Wikimedia Commons, CC BY 2.0","url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Google_team_group_photo_with_Vanhanen-Sergey_Brin_cropped.png"},"PER-00029":{"data":"img/6868e0c9b80fd075.jpg","credit":"Photo: Brian Smale and Microsoft / Wikimedia Commons, CC BY-SA 4.0","url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:MS-Exec-Nadella-Satya-2017-08-31-22_(cropped).jpg"},"PER-00030":{"data":"img/5