r to Israel in 2021–25 (accounting for 68 per cent of Israeli arms imports), followed by Germany (31 per cent).","pg":null}]},{"id":"REL-V0136","t":"money","a":"CTY-00005","b":"CTY-00001","rel":"licensed_arms_exports_to","amt":127600000,"cur":"GBP","pct":null,"date":"2024-10 to 2024-12","st":"documented","ctx":"CAAT: the UK approved £127.6M of single-issue licences for military equipment to Israel in Q4 2024, more than 2020–2023 combined; F-35 components exempted from the Sept 2024 partial suspension.","ev":[{"s":"SRC-V0047","ex":"the UK approved licenses for £127.6 million worth of military equipment to Israel in single issue licenses between October to December 2024. ... UK industry makes 15% of every F-35","pg":null},{"s":"SRC-V0048","ex":"licences for the export of components for F-35 combat aircraft which could not be identified as destined for Israel","pg":null}]},{"id":"REL-V0137","t":"money","a":"CTY-00004","b":"CTY-00001","rel":"arms_exports_to","amt":5800000,"cur":"EUR","pct":null,"date":"2024","st":"documented","ctx":"ISTAT Coeweb data cited by Il Fatto Quotidiano show about €5.8M of arms, ammunition and parts exported to Israel in 2024 despite government claims of a halt.","ev":[{"s":"SRC-V0044","ex":"Nel 2024 ... l'Italia autorizzava, testimoniano i dati Coeweb ... esportazioni di 'armi, munizioni e loro parti ed accessori per circa 5,8 milioni di euro ... una cooperazione stabile nel programma degli aerei F-35, con componentistica prodotta in Italia e destinata ai velivoli israeliani","pg":null}]},{"id":"REL-V0138","t":"money","a":"CTY-00021","b":"CTY-00001","rel":"ammunition_exports_to","amt":55500000,"cur":"EUR","pct":null,"date":"2025-01 to 2025-06","st":"reported","ctx":"BIRN/Haaretz: Serbian ammunition exports to Israel were €55.5M in H1 2025, after €47.9M in 2024.","ev":[{"s":"SRC-V0075","ex":"€47.9 million (2024) ... €55.5 million (first half of 2025)","pg":null}]},{"id":"REL-V0139","t":"edge","a":"CTY-00003","b":"CTR-00006","rel":"procures_via","amt":null,"cur":null,"pct":null,"date":"2023-09-28 onward","st":"documented","ctx":"Germany's Arrow 3 purchase from IAI, now above $6.5B.","ev":[{"s":"SRC-V0034","ex":"The USA was the largest supplier to Israel in 2021–25 (accounting for 68 per cent of Israeli arms imports), followed by Germany (31 per cent).","pg":null}]},{"id":"REL-V0140","t":"edge","a":"CTY-00003","b":"COM-00009","rel":"procures_from","amt":2000000000,"cur":"EUR","pct":null,"date":"2025-10-24","st":"documented","ctx":"€2B Spike missile contract signed via NSPA with EuroSpike, led by Rafael with Rheinmetall and Diehl.","ev":[{"s":"SRC-V0042","ex":"The contract was signed with EuroSpike, a European joint venture based in Bavaria and led by Tel Aviv's Rafael, with German companies Rheinmetall Electronics and Diehl Defence holding an 80 percent stake. (2 billion euros ($2.3 billion))","pg":null}]},{"id":"REL-V0141","t":"edge","a":"CTY-00017","b":"CTR-00007","rel":"procures_via","amt":316000000,"cur":"EUR","pct":null,"date":"2023-11","st":"documented","ctx":"Finland's David's Sling procurement; minister refused to cancel in Aug 2025.","ev":[{"s":"SRC-V0072","ex":"There are no talks about cancelling the deal, it is proceeding as planned","pg":null}]},{"id":"REL-V0142","t":"edge","a":"CTY-00014","b":"CTR-00008","rel":"procures_via","amt":null,"cur":null,"pct":null,"date":"2023","st":"documented","ctx":"Denmark's ATMOS/PULS purchase from Elbit.","ev":[{"s":"SRC-V0069","ex":"Danish media Danwatch and Information revealed in 2023 that Israel's F-35s were equipped with parts made by Danish company Terma.","pg":null}]},{"id":"REL-V0143","t":"edge","a":"CTY-00018","b":"CTR-00009","rel":"procures_via","amt":560000000,"cur":"EUR","pct":null,"date":"2024-12-23","st":"documented","ctx":"Slovakia's Barak MX purchase from IAI.","ev":[{"s":"SRC-V0058","ex":"Between 2014-2022 the total value of export licences between Bulgaria and Israel total €49 million ... from Slovakia to Israel totalled €117 million ... Hungary ... over €15 million ... the Czech Republic has transferred over €127 million ... Austria ... €33 million ... Poland ... just shy of €4.9 million ... Spain ... €99 million ... Belgium has transferred €46 million ... Romania ... €427 million","pg":null}]},{"id":"REL-V0144","t":"edge","a":"CTY-00015","b":"CTR-00010","rel":"procures_via","amt":3000000000,"cur":"EUR","pct":null,"date":"2026-08-31","st":"documented","ctx":"Greece's Achilles Shield package (David's Sling, SPYDER, Barak MX).","ev":[{"s":"SRC-V0070","ex":"Greece is formally acquiring the Precise and Universal Launching System (PULS) rocket artillery system in a $750 million agreement ... The deal includes the launchers as well as training rockets, precision-guided rockets and loitering munitions.","pg":null}]},{"id":"REL-V0145","t":"edge","a":"CTY-00015","b":"COM-00007","rel":"procures_from","amt":750000000,"cur":"USD","pct":null,"date":"2026-04","st":"documented","ctx":"Greece's $750M PULS rocket artillery deal with Elbit.","ev":[{"s":"SRC-V0070","ex":"Greece is formally acquiring the Precise and Universal Launching System (PULS) rocket artillery system in a $750 million agreement ... The deal includes the launchers as well as training rockets, precision-guided rockets and loitering munitions.","pg":null}]},{"id":"REL-V0146","t":"edge","a":"CTY-00007","b":"COM-00007","rel":"procures_from","amt":305000000,"cur":"USD","pct":null,"date":"2023-05-18","st":"documented","ctx":"Dutch G2G deal for 20 Elbit PULS systems.","ev":[{"s":"SRC-V0054","ex":"it was awarded a contract worth $305 million to supply Precise & Universal Launching System (PULS) artillery rocket systems to the Royal Netherlands Army","pg":null}]},{"id":"REL-V0147","t":"edge","a":"CTY-00010","b":"COM-00009","rel":"procures_from","amt":2000000000,"cur":"EUR","pct":null,"date":"2025-07-21","st":"documented","ctx":"Romanian SPYDER framework agreement with Rafael, more than €2B ($2.3B).","ev":[{"s":"SRC-V0062","ex":"more than 2 billion euros ($2.3 billion) (SPYDER framework agreement with Rafael Advanced Defense Systems)","pg":null}]},{"id":"REL-V0148","t":"edge","a":"CTY-00010","b":"COM-00007","rel":"procures_from","amt":400000000,"cur":"USD","pct":null,"date":"reported 2025-11","st":"reported","ctx":"Romania's $400M deal with Elbit for seven Watchkeeper X systems.","ev":[{"s":"SRC-V0063","ex":"Romania's Defense Ministry concluded a USD 400 million deal with Israeli company Elbit for the development of seven Watchkeeper X systems","pg":null}]},{"id":"REL-V0149","t":"edge","a":"CTY-00009","b":"COM-00009","rel":"procures_from","amt":627000000,"cur":"USD","pct":null,"date":"2021-09-28","st":"documented","ctx":"Czech SPYDER purchase, four launchers due by 2026.","ev":[{"s":"SRC-V0060","ex":"13.69 billion koruna (US$627 million) ... Deliveries of the four launchers are scheduled to be completed by 2026","pg":null}]},{"id":"REL-V0150","t":"money","a":"CTY-00012","b":"COM-00009","rel":"licensed_production_of","amt":100000000,"cur":"USD","pct":null,"date":"2023-08-07","st":"documented","ctx":"Mesko to produce hundreds of Rafael Spike missiles, contract near $100M.","ev":[{"s":"SRC-V0067","ex":"near $100 million, according to a statement released by the Israeli vendor (Spike missiles to be made by Mesko under Rafael licence)","pg":null}]},{"id":"REL-V0151","t":"edge","a":"CTY-00013","b":"COM-00007","rel":"procures_from","amt":null,"cur":null,"pct":null,"date":"2025-08","st":"documented","ctx":"Austrian army buys 315 Magni-X drones from Elbit Systems Deutschland.","ev":[{"s":"SRC-V0068","ex":"315 Magni-X tactical reconnaissance drones ... an option to acquire an additional 300 drones (Elbit Systems Deutschland)","pg":null}]},{"id":"REL-V0152","t":"edge","a":"CTY-00016","b":"COM-00008","rel":"procures_from","amt":null,"cur":null,"pct":null,"date":"2024-12","st":"documented","ctx":"Cyprus receives IAI Barak MX; value undisclosed.","ev":[{"s":"SRC-V0071","ex":"Initial deliveries of the system have reportedly arrived in re