r":null,"pct":null,"date":null,"st":"reported","ctx":"Leonardo is Italy's state-controlled weapons manufacturer; the Italian Treasury holds 30.2%. Leonardo says its F-35 wing and maintenance work at Cameri is not destined for Israel.","ev":[{"s":"SRC-V0044","ex":"Nel 2024 ... l'Italia autorizzava, testimoniano i dati Coeweb ... esportazioni di 'armi, munizioni e loro parti ed accessori per circa 5,8 milioni di euro ... una cooperazione stabile nel programma degli aerei F-35, con componentistica prodotta in Italia e destinata ai velivoli israeliani","pg":null},{"s":"SRC-V0320","ex":"Le produzioni di assiemi alari (Wing) e i servizi di supporto (MRO&U) effettuati presso lo stabilimento di Cameri a fronte dei contratti con Lockheed Martin (LM) sono destinati da LM stessa anche a Paesi terzi, ma NON allo Stato di Israele.","pg":null}]},{"id":"REL-V0158","t":"edge","a":"CTY-00001","b":"GOV-00005","rel":"country_governed_by","amt":null,"cur":null,"pct":null,"date":null,"st":"documented","ctx":"The Government of Israel governs the Israel country node.","ev":[{"s":"SRC-V0025","ex":"Israeli authorities and Israeli security forces committed four of the five genocidal acts defined by the 1948 Convention on the Prevention and Punishment of the Crime of Genocide","pg":null}]},{"id":"REL-V0159","t":"election","a":"ORG-00003","b":"PER-V001","rel":"spent_supporting","amt":2000000,"cur":"USD","pct":null,"date":"NC-04 Dem primary · 2022 · won","st":"reported","ctx":"United Democracy Project, AIPAC's super PAC, spent about $2.0M backing Valerie Foushee in the 2022 NC-04 Dem primary. Result: won.","ev":[{"s":"SRC-V0287","ex":null,"pg":null}]},{"id":"REL-V0160","t":"election","a":"ORG-00003","b":"PER-V002","rel":"spent_supporting","amt":280000,"cur":"USD","pct":null,"date":"OH-11 Dem primary · 2022 · won","st":"reported","ctx":"United Democracy Project, AIPAC's super PAC, spent about $0.3M backing Shontel Brown in the 2022 OH-11 Dem primary. Result: won.","ev":[{"s":"SRC-V0287","ex":nul