lion) and Allianz's asset management subsidiary PIMCO ($960 million) – were among at least 400 investors from 36 countries who purchased them.","pg":null}],"t":"money"},{"a":"FND-00002","b":"GOV-00005","rel":"bought_treasury_bonds","amt":546000000,"cur":"USD","pct":null,"date":"2024–2025","ctx":"The UN Special Rapporteur reports Vanguard bought $546M of Israeli treasury bonds.","id":"REL-W0022","st":"documented","ev":[{"s":"SRC-V0004","ex":"Asset management firms – including Blackrock ($68 million), Vanguard ($546 million) and Allianz's asset management subsidiary PIMCO ($960 million) – were among at least 400 investors from 36 countries who purchased them.","pg":null}],"t":"money"},{"a":"FND-00001","b":"GOV-00005","rel":"bought_treasury_bonds","amt":68000000,"cur":"USD","pct":null,"date":"2024–2025","ctx":"The UN Special Rapporteur reports BlackRock bought $68M of Israeli treasury bonds.","id":"REL-W0023","st":"documented","ev":[{"s":"SRC-V0004","ex":"Asset management firms – including Blackrock ($68 million), Vanguard ($546 million) and Allianz's asset management subsidiary PIMCO ($960 million) – were among at least 400 investors from 36 countries who purchased them.","pg":null}],"t":"money"},{"a":"FND-00002","b":"COM-00007","rel":"shareholder_of","amt":null,"cur":null,"pct":2,"date":"2025","ctx":"Named in the UN Special Rapporteur's July 2025 report as Elbit Systems' second-largest institutional investor.","id":"REL-W0024","st":"documented","ev":[{"s":"SRC-V0004","ex":"second largest in Lockheed Martin (9.2 per cent) and Elbit Systems (2.0 per cent)","pg":null}],"t":"edge"},{"a":"FND-00002","b":"COM-NEW-CATERPILLAR","rel":"shareholder_of","amt":null,"cur":null,"pct":9.8,"date":"2025","ctx":"Named in the UN Special Rapporteur's report as Caterpillar's largest institutional investor.","id":"REL-W0025","st":"documented","ev":[{"s":"SRC-V0004","ex":"Vanguard is the largest institutional investor in Caterpillar (9.8 per cent)","pg":null}],"t":"edge"},{"a":"FND-00001",