with JDAM kits at Khadija school in Gaza (27 July 2024) and in the demolition of at least seven Gaza City high-rises in 2025. OHCHR assessed GBU-32 (1,000-lb JDAM) use at Jabalia camp.","transfers":[{"date":"2025-02-07","what":"2,800 Mk-82 500-lb bomb bodies (approved maximum)","value_usd":null,"src":"https://www.dsca.mil/Press-Media/Major-Arms-Sales/Article-Display/Article/4060920/israel-munitions-guidance-kits-fuzes-and-munitions-support"},{"date":"2025-02-28","what":"201 Mk-83 and 4,799 BLU-110 bombs with 5,000 JDAM kits, $675.7M (approved maximum; deliveries from 2028)","value_usd":675700000,"src":"https://www.dsca.mil/Press-Media/Major-Arms-Sales/Article-Display/Article/4088252/israel-munitions-guidance-kits-and-munitions-support"}],"status":"documented"},{"id":"ARS-BLU109","name":"BLU-109 2,000-lb penetrator","aka":["GBU-31(V)3 with JDAM","bunker buster"],"class":"bunker buster","form":"bomb","dims":{"length_m":2.41,"diameter_m":0.37,"span_m":null,"weight_kg":910},"specs":[{"k":"Weight","v":"2,000 lb (910 kg)","src":["SRC-W0118"]},{"k":"Case","v":"steel casing about 25 mm thick","src":["SRC-W0118"]},{"k":"Fill","v":"550 lb (250 kg) Tritonal","src":["SRC-W0118"]},{"k":"Fuze","v":"FMU-143 delayed-action tail fuze","src":["SRC-W0118"]},{"k":"Guidance","v":"KMU-557 JDAM kit (GBU-31 configuration)","src":["SRC-0027"]},{"k":"Feb 2025 sale","v":"3,475 KMU-557 JDAM kits for BLU-109 (approved maximum)","src":["SRC-0027"]},{"k":"Earlier delivery","v":"100 BLU-109s delivered to Israel in late 2023 (reported)","src":["SRC-W0118"]}],"makers":[{"entity":"COM-00003","role":"guidance (KMU-557 JDAM kit)","src":["SRC-0027"]}],"parts":[{"name":"Thick steel penetrator case","maker":"unattributed","start":0,"end":0.75,"note":"Maker of Israel-bound cases not established in sources reviewed.","src":["SRC-W0062","SRC-W0063","SRC-W0063","SRC-W0064","SRC-W0065","SRC-W0066","SRC-W0067","SRC-W0067","SRC-W0068","SRC-W0069","SRC-W0070","SRC-W0071","SRC-W0072","SRC-W0073","SRC-W0072","SRC-W