065","SRC-W0066","SRC-W0067","SRC-W0067","SRC-W0071","SRC-W0071","SRC-W0071","SRC-W0070","SRC-W0091","SRC-W0068","SRC-W0090","SRC-W0090","SRC-W0072","SRC-W0069","SRC-W0078","SRC-W0082","SRC-W0075","SRC-W0063","SRC-W0070","SRC-W0082","SRC-W0076","SRC-W0096","SRC-W0067","SRC-W0069","SRC-W0068","SRC-W0071","SRC-W0065","SRC-W0067","SRC-W0086","SRC-W0087","SRC-W0086","SRC-W0108","SRC-W0067","SRC-W0087","SRC-W0086","SRC-W0067","SRC-W0087","SRC-W0097","SRC-W0067","SRC-W0096","SRC-W0075","SRC-W0074","SRC-W0068","SRC-W0092","SRC-W0072","SRC-W0069","SRC-W0092","SRC-W0063","SRC-W0062","SRC-W0068","SRC-W0092","SRC-W0085","SRC-W0065","SRC-W0075","SRC-W0092","SRC-W0062","SRC-W0076","SRC-W0071","SRC-W0092","SRC-W0075","SRC-W0096","SRC-W0068","SRC-W0077","SRC-W0072","SRC-W0082","SRC-W0075","SRC-W0069","SRC-W0092","SRC-W0091","SRC-W0085","SRC-W0072","SRC-W0090","SRC-W0063","SRC-W0092","SRC-W0071","SRC-W0068","SRC-W0075","SRC-W0064","SRC-W0076","SRC-W0069","SRC-W0065","SRC-W0092","SRC-W0062","SRC-W0075","SRC-W0105","SRC-W0068","SRC-W0092","SRC-W0071","SRC-W0077","SRC-W0076","SRC-W0085","SRC-W0078","SRC-W0062","SRC-W0063","SRC-W0092","SRC-W0074","SRC-W0068","SRC-W0065","SRC-W0063","SRC-W0077","SRC-W0085","SRC-W0082","SRC-W0063","SRC-W0072","SRC-W0076","SRC-W0069","SRC-W0092","SRC-W0072","SRC-W0069","SRC-W0092","SRC-W0078","SRC-W0075","SRC-W0103","SRC-W0075","SRC-W0067"]}],"summary":"The AGM-114 Hellfire is a Lockheed Martin missile built in Troy, Alabama, fired by Israel's Apache helicopters and drones; a FY2021 unit was about $150,000. On 7 February 2025 the US notified Israel of 3,000 more ($660M), with deliveries from 2028. Bellingcat's February 2026 investigation of US munitions in Gaza found a Hellfire in the June 2024 strike on a Gaza City clinic that killed Hani al-Jafarawi, director of Gaza's ambulance and emergency services, Hellfires in four strikes on tents within about 150 m of Al-Aqsa Martyrs Hospital in Deir al-Balah, and Hellfire remnants at Cairo Basic School in July 2025, where five people were reportedly killed. Bellingcat geolocated 79 incidents involving Hellfire, GBU-39 or JDAM remnants, with reports of at least 744 deaths, while noting individual tolls cannot all be independently verified.","transfers":[{"date":"2025-02-07","what":"3,000 AGM-114 Hellfire missiles, deliveries estimated from 2028","value_usd":660000000,"src":"https://www.dsca.mil/Press-Media/Major-Arms-Sales/Article-Display/Article/4060949/israel-agm-114-hellfire-missiles"}],"status":"documented"},{"id":"ARS-SPIKE","name":"Spike missile family (incl. Spike NLOS)","aka":["Spike NLOS","Spike ER","Tammuz"],"class":"missile","form":"missile","dims":{"length_m":1.67,"diameter_m":0.17,"span_m":null,"weight_kg":34},"specs":[{"k":"Spike ER weight / size (dims shown)","v":"34 kg; 1,670 mm long; 170 mm diameter","src":["SRC-V0112"]},{"k":"Spike NLOS weight","v":"about 70 kg","src":["SRC-V0112"]},{"k":"Range","v":"Spike ER 0.4-8 km; NLOS up to 32 km (50 km air-launched)","src":["SRC-V0112"]},{"k":"Warhead","v":"HEAT tandem charge","src":["SRC-V0112"]},{"k":"Guidance","v":"IIR / CCD electro-optical, operator in the loop","src":["SRC-V0112"]},{"k":"Unit cost","v":"$249,966 (US Army Spike NLOS, 2022)","src":["SRC-V0112"]},{"k":"Platforms","v":"Hermes 450 (up to 4), Apache helicopters, ships","src":["SRC-V0109"]}],"makers":[{"entity":"COM-00009","role":"prime","src":["SRC-V0112"]},{"entity":"EuroSpike GmbH (Diehl, Rheinmetall, Rafael joint venture)","role":"European production","src":["SRC-V0112"]},{"entity":"COM-00024","role":"European production partner (Rheinmetall electronics unit)","src":["SRC-V0112"]}],"parts":[{"name":"Electro-optical seeker","maker":"COM-00009","start":0,"end":0.15,"note":"","src":["SRC-W0062","SRC-W0063","SRC-W0063","SRC-W0064","SRC-W0065","SRC-W0066","SRC-W0067","SRC-W0067","SRC-W0068","SRC-W0069","SRC-W0070","SRC-W0071","SRC-W0072","SRC-W0073","SRC-W0072","SRC-W0064","SRC-W0068","SRC-W0074","SRC-W0072","SRC-W0075","SRC-W0070","SRC-W0076","SRC-W00