-W0077","SRC-W0065","SRC-W0063","SRC-W0092","SRC-W0072","SRC-W0065","SRC-W0077","SRC-W0075","SRC-W0068","SRC-W0090","SRC-W0072","SRC-W0092","SRC-W0093","SRC-W0092","SRC-W0101","SRC-W0088"]},{"name":"Rear fuselage","maker":"COM-00006","start":0.65,"end":0.9,"note":"","src":["SRC-W0062","SRC-W0063","SRC-W0063","SRC-W0064","SRC-W0065","SRC-W0066","SRC-W0067","SRC-W0067","SRC-W0071","SRC-W0071","SRC-W0071","SRC-W0070","SRC-W0091","SRC-W0075","SRC-W0068","SRC-W0065","SRC-W0094","SRC-W0065","SRC-W0063","SRC-W0068","SRC-W0096","SRC-W0065","SRC-W0070","SRC-W0082","SRC-W0076","SRC-W0096","SRC-W0067","SRC-W0068","SRC-W0069","SRC-W0067","SRC-W0064","SRC-W0077","SRC-W0076","SRC-W0074","SRC-W0085","SRC-W0082","SRC-W0063","SRC-W0067","SRC-W0093","SRC-W0101","SRC-W0088","SRC-W0092","SRC-W0090","SRC-W0072","SRC-W0078","SRC-W0062","SRC-W0063","SRC-W0069","SRC-W0072","SRC-W0069","SRC-W0078","SRC-W0092","SRC-W0072","SRC-W0072"]},{"name":"F135 engine","maker":"COM-00001","start":0.55,"end":1,"note":"","src":["SRC-W0062","SRC-W0063","SRC-W0063","SRC-W0064","SRC-W0065","SRC-W0066","SRC-W0067","SRC-W0067","SRC-W0072","SRC-W0069","SRC-W0105","SRC-W0068","SRC-W0065","SRC-W0063","SRC-W0072","SRC-W0078","SRC-W0075","SRC-W0063","SRC-W0068","SRC-W0070","SRC-W0075","SRC-W0093","SRC-W0065","SRC-W0082","SRC-W0070","SRC-W0076","SRC-W0077","SRC-W0078","SRC-W0067","SRC-W0082","SRC-W0076","SRC-W0096","SRC-W0064","SRC-W0075","SRC-W0069","SRC-W0094","SRC-W0067","SRC-W0077","SRC-W0063","SRC-W0104"]}],"summary":"The F-35I Adir is Israel's version of Lockheed Martin's stealth jet, built with Northrop Grumman's centre fuselage, BAE Systems' rear fuselage and RTX's Pratt & Whitney engine; the UN Special Rapporteur counts at least 1,650 other companies in the programme. Israel has ordered 75; the third squadron of 25, about $3B, was paid for with US aid. UN Special Rapporteur Francesca Albanese reported in 2025 that F-35s and F-16s were integral to Israel dropping an estimated 85,000 tons of bombs on Gaza. Israel flew the F-35I against Iran in the June 2025 Twelve-Day War and in the 2026 war; on 4 March 2026 an F-35I shot down an Iranian Yak-130 over Tehran, the IDF said. Individual Gaza or Lebanon strikes are rarely tied to a specific aircraft type, so no civilian-harm event here is assigned to it alone.","transfers":[{"date":"2023-07-05","what":"25 F-35 (third squadron), fleet to 75, financed with US aid","value_usd":3000000000,"src":"https://www.lockheedmartin.com/f35/news-and-features/Israel-acquire-third-squadron-f35-aircraft.html"}],"status":"documented"},{"id":"ARS-F15I","name":"F-15I Ra'am / F-15IA","aka":["F-15I","F-15IA (F-15EX variant)","69 Squadron"],"class":"aircraft","form":"aircraft","dims":{"length_m":null,"diameter_m":null,"span_m":null,"weight_kg":null},"specs":[{"k":"Israeli fleet","v":"25 F-15I built 1996-98, flown by 69 Squadron","src":["SRC-W0137"]},{"k":"Other F-15s","v":"66 other F-15 variants in the Israeli Air Force","src":["SRC-W0138"]},{"k":"New order (Nov 2024)","v":"25 F-15IA, $5.2B, deliveries from 2031","src":["SRC-W0138"]},{"k":"Boeing contract (Dec 2025)","v":"$8.6B Pentagon contract for 25 F-15IA plus option for 25 more","src":["SRC-W0138"]},{"k":"Documented load","v":"BLU-109 + JDAM (Nasrallah strike, Sept 2024)","src":["SRC-W0139"]}],"makers":[{"entity":"COM-00003","role":"prime","src":["SRC-W0138"]}],"parts":[{"name":"Airframe","maker":"COM-00003","start":0,"end":1,"note":"Component suppliers not researched.","src":["SRC-W0062","SRC-W0063","SRC-W0063","SRC-W0064","SRC-W0065","SRC-W0066","SRC-W0067","SRC-W0067","SRC-W0071","SRC-W0071","SRC-W0071","SRC-W0070","SRC-W0063","SRC-W0072","SRC-W0096","SRC-W0068","SRC-W0065","SRC-W0076","SRC-W0093","SRC-W0072","SRC-W0065","SRC-W0077","SRC-W0075","SRC-W0068","SRC-W0090","SRC-W0070","SRC-W0082","SRC-W0076","SRC-W0096","SRC-W0067","SRC-W0064","SRC-W0068","SRC-W0069","SRC-W0063","SRC-W0075","SRC-W0078","SRC-W0076","SRC-W0069","SRC-W0092","SRC-W0075","SRC-W0069","SRC-W0069","SRC-W0076","SRC-W0085","SRC-W0069","SRC-W0082","SRC-W0068","SRC-W0065","SRC-W0092","SRC-W0100","SRC-W0092","SRC-W0108","SRC-W0092","SRC-W0091","SRC-W0072","SRC-W0090","SRC-W0090","SRC-W0072","SRC-W0076","SRC-W0069","SRC-W0092","SRC-W0091","SRC-W0076","SRC-W0068","SRC-W0072","SRC-W0069","SRC-W0078","SRC-W0092","SRC-W0082","SRC-W0076","SRC-W0069","SRC-W0063","SRC-W0077","SRC-W0075","SRC-W0082","SRC-W0063","SRC-W0092","SRC-W0093","SRC-W0076","SRC-W0077","SRC-W0092","SRC-W0072","SRC-W0065","SRC-W0077","SRC-W0075","SRC-W0068","SRC-W0090","SRC-W0072","SRC-W0092","SRC-W0093","SRC-W0092","SRC-W0089","SRC-W0088","SRC-W0092","SRC-W0093","SRC-W0072","SRC-W0078","SRC-W0062","SRC-W0063","SRC-W0068","SRC-W0077","SRC-W0092","SRC-W0098","SRC-W0068","SRC-W0063","SRC-W0065","SRC-W0067"]}],"summary":"The F-15I Ra'am is the Boeing strike jet flown by the Israeli Air Force's 69 Squadron; Israel received 25 in 1996-98 and flies 66 other F-15 variants. In November 2024 Israel signed a $5.2B deal for 25 new F-15IAs, and on 30 December 2025 the Pentagon announced an $8.6B Boeing contract for 25 with an option for 25 more. Times of Israel says the F-15s saw heavy use against Iran, Yemen and Lebanon over the previous two years. The best-documented case is the 27 September 2024 strike that killed Hassan Nasrallah in Haret Hreik, Beirut's southern suburbs: Times of Israel reported eight 69 Squadron F-15Is, which an analyst cited by the New York Times said carried at least 15 2,000-lb bombs with US guidance, and an IDF image showed BLU-109s with JDAM kits on one of the jets.","transfers":[{"date":"2024-11","what":"25 F-15IA, deliveries from 2031","value_usd":5200000000,"src":"https://www.timesofisrael.com/pentagon-announces-8-6-billion-boeing-contract-for-israeli-f-15-fighter-jets/"},{"date":"2025-12-30","what":"Pentagon contract to Boeing for 25 F-15IA plus option for 25","value_usd":8600000000,"src":"https://www.timesofisrael.com/pentagon-announces-8-6-billion-boeing-contract-for-israeli-f-15-fighter-jets/"}],"sta